      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145\" title=\"20220416_154711\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145_2_375x500.jpeg\" alt=\"20220416_154711\" data-base62-sha1=\"usFih1aHhYfPPOFXQ6mxJxyXPmZ\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145_2_375x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145_2_562x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145_2_750x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d57ec3ef08a85d2dd7abf5deb20be48668c62145_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220416_154711</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2560 293 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nI can’t believe all this time, that character card was just… under the table. The game has gone through two separate revisions since then. I’ve gone to college, dropped out, gone back, and graduated since then.<br>\nI guess Original Wraith’s Stealth really WAS overpowered.</p>",
